<ProjectPage Url="/projects/formula-student-ai" Kicker="Personal Project · Leeds Formula Student AI team">
                <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                    Contributing to Leeds University's autonomous racing team, developing simulation environments and exploring autonomous vehicle subsystems for international Formula Student AI competition
                </p>
                <!-- Project Overview & Team Context -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Formula Student AI: The Competition" Icon="fas fa-flag-checkered">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Formula Student AI is the premier international engineering competition for autonomous racing systems, where university teams design, build, and race self-driving formula-style cars. Beyond traditional Formula Student's mechanical and electrical challenges, FS-AI demands cutting-edge autonomous vehicle technology combining perception, planning, control, and real-time decision making.</p>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Competition Challenges</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Dynamic Events:</strong> Acceleration, skidpad, autocross, endurance racing</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Static Events:</strong> Engineering design, cost analysis, business presentations</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Autonomous Systems:</strong> Full self-driving capability required</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Safety & Reliability:</strong> Mission-critical autonomous performance</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Leeds University FS-AI Team</h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Team Focus:</strong> Autonomous racing systems development</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Mission:</strong> International Formula Student AI competition</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Approach:</strong> Multidisciplinary collaborative engineering</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Goal:</strong> Prove autonomous vehicle capability on track</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

