                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Strategic Position</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            Joined the simulation team to gain comprehensive exposure to autonomous vehicle development. While formally positioned in simulation, the role provides unique opportunity to interface with and contribute to all autonomous subsystems—perception, planning, localization, and control—through simulation environment design and validation.
                        </p>
                    </div>

