                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Proof-of-Concept Validation:</strong> Demonstrate autonomous car movement and control</li>
                                <li>• <strong>System Integration Testing:</strong> Validate subsystem interactions before hardware deployment</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Environment Development:</strong> ROS2-based simulation infrastructure</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Risk Mitigation:</strong> Test autonomous behaviors safely before real-world testing</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
