                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li>• <strong>Cross-Functional Contribution:</strong> Input across perception, planning, and control</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Systems Thinking:</strong> Understanding how components integrate holistically</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Progressive Learning:</strong> Gradual expansion into autonomous vehicle subsystems</li>
                                <li>• <strong>Team Collaboration:</strong> Working with multidisciplinary engineering teams</li>
