                        <p class="text-gray-300">
                            The simulation team's work is particularly critical this year—previous competition saw the vehicle fail to move from the start line. This year's focus on robust simulation-based validation ensures autonomous systems are proven functional before competition day, reducing risk and enabling confident deployment.
                        </p>
